## 6. Fast-path `_cachedIp` staleness

Definition and intent (`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/common/common_glasses_p2p/lib/src/glasses_p2p_visual_stream.dart`):

```46:53:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/common/common_glasses_p2p/lib/src/glasses_p2p_visual_stream.dart
  // Cached Group Owner IP from the last successful P2P connect.
  // Reused by the fast-path on subsequent connect() calls to skip the full
  // P2P handshake (~5–15 s). Cleared when the fast-path itself fails.
  String? _cachedIp;

  static const _fastPathTimeout = Duration(seconds: 3);
```

### Invalidation paths

| Trigger | Clears `_cachedIp`? |
|---|---|
| Fast-path RTSP fails (3s timeout) | ✅ line 96 |
| `fullDisconnect()` | ✅ line 228 |
| `disconnect()` (page exit, normal teardown) | ❌ intentionally kept (line 217–218) |
| BLE disconnect event | ❌ `fullDisconnect()` never wired |
| Glasses reboot / IP change / phone Wi-Fi network change | ❌ no proactive invalidation |
| App process kill | ✅ (in-memory only) |

Fast-path logic:

```86:103:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/common/common_glasses_p2p/lib/src/glasses_p2p_visual_stream.dart
    final cached = _cachedIp;
    if (cached != null) {
      try {
        await _connectRtsp(cached, timeout: _fastPathTimeout);
        return;
      } catch (e) {
        _cachedIp = null;
        final failed = _inner;
        _inner = null;
        await failed?.disconnect();
      }
    }
```

### Staleness scenarios

1. **Re-enter识物 page:** controller calls `disconnect()` → `_cachedIp` survives → next `connect()` tries stale IP with 3s fast-path, then falls back to full BLE+P2P on failure. Worst case: +3s delay, not indefinite wrong stream.

2. **Glasses reboot with same IP (`192.168.10.1` / group owner):** fast-path might connect RTSP to wrong/no stream until VLC fails — then full reconnect.

3. **Phone joins different network while `_cachedIp` set:** fast-path RTSP to glasses IP likely fails within 3s → fallback. No TTL means every reconnect attempt pays 3s tax until failure.

4. **P2P group dead but IP remembered:** same 3s probe per `connect()`; no background invalidation.

5. **`visualStreamProvider` is app-scoped** in `glasses_app` — `_cachedIp` persists across multiple识物 page visits within one app session.

**No expiry/TTL, no BLE lifecycle hook, no network-change listener.** Relies entirely on fast-path try/catch failure handling.

