## Architecture snapshot (for gap analysis)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as ObjectRecognitionPage
    participant C as ObjectRecognitionController
    participant G as GlassesP2pVisualStream
    participant BLE as GlassesCommandSender
    participant NAT as GlassesP2pPlugin
    participant VLC as VlcVisualStream

    UI->>C: build() → startPreview()
    C->>G: connect(mock config)
    G->>G: fast-path _cachedIp? → RTSP
    G->>BLE: openWifiAP / setWifiP2p(open)
    BLE-->>G: GlassesWifiP2pEvent(ssid, password)
    G->>NAT: connectP2P(ssid)
    NAT-->>G: IP (192.168.10.1 or GO IP)
    G->>VLC: connect(rtsp://ip:554/vs0...)
    VLC-->>C: events (previewing/error/disconnected)
    C->>UI: visualStatus + error banner

    Note over C,G: Page exit: disconnect() only<br/>fullDisconnect() never called
```

