## Summary gap list (requirements-oriented)

| Area | Current state | Gap |
|---|---|---|
| iOS native P2P | NEHotspotConfiguration implemented | Entitlements + `NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription` missing from repo; docs say “stub” |
| iOS app wiring | `glasses_app` uses full P2P path | `pkg_showcase` iOS uses camera only; asymmetric testing |
| Camera fallback | Dead code in `GlassesP2pVisualStream` on iOS | Only `GLASSES_P2P_NOT_SUPPORTED` triggers it; Swift never throws that |
| P2P teardown | `disconnect()` keeps group + cache | `fullDisconnect()` exists but unused; BLE disconnect doesn't clean up |
| `_cachedIp` | No TTL | Survives page exit; 3s penalty on stale reconnect; no BLE/network invalidation |
| Mid-session drop | `disconnected` → pill only | No auto-reconnect; spec says error is recoverable but Feature doesn't retry |
| Preview retry UI | Error banner only | No manual “重试预览” button |
| `startPreview` | Once per controller | Re-navigation creates new controller but reuses cached stream/IP |
| Permissions (Android) | Complete in both apps | Runtime permission handled in plugin |
| Permissions (iOS) | BLE + mic only | Missing local network plist key + hotspot/WiFi entitlements |
| Tests | Mock visual stream only | No integration tests for P2P pipeline |
